Subject: [PATCH] Integrate Curtis White TC-MoE with r7 arenas and fused apply

DeepSeek port and original hook by Curtis White (CurtisAccelerate).
Kernels by Morrowmake; codec adapted from Turboderp, MIT.
Compile from source with torch 2.14 / CUDA 13.0; keep coop below 43 rows.

Origin: CurtisAccelerate/DeepSeekv41-Flash-EXL3-TC-MoE@88eb6e13de0ea5491579fddb195116a4176f4bc7; r10 integration
Upstream: Morrowmake/vllm-cmp170hx@18305948acba3f4c4d912cdd56f2202d2ebd94e8

